    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "source-connected-branches",
        "description": "One unlabelled circuit, not separate panels. Aerial tap above the left tuning junction; lower tuning junction descends to the ground/common return. Coil and variable capacitor join the SAME upper/lower tuning nodes. The aerial tap continues right through the right-pointing triangular diode and its vertical bar to the detector upper junction. Detector upper/lower junctions carry the fixed-capacitor branch and right headphone branch; the lower detector junction joins the ground/common return. Every endpoint below is mapped to executable connectivity; no wire bypasses a capacitor or the diode.",
